{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BE3HtJqSLJ6qYKksgCdsex","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"number\": 626,\n3\t  \"title\": \"[BUG] Syntax with line_range and word_wrap=True omits the final line\",\n4\t  \"body\": \"- [x] I've checked docs and closed issues for possible solutions.\\n- [x] I can't find my issue in the FAQ.\\n\\n**Describe the bug**\\n\\nWhen `word_wrap=True`, the last line of `line_range` is missing.\\n\\n```python\\nfrom rich.console import Console\\nfrom rich.syntax import Syntax\\n\\ncode = \\\"a = 1\\\\nb = 2\\\\nc = 3\\\\nd = 4\\\\n\\\"\\nConsole(width=40).print(Syntax(code, \\\"python\\\", line_range=(2, 4), word_wrap=True))\\n```\\n\\nI expected `b = 2`, `c = 3` and `d = 4`; `d = 4` is not printed.\\n\\n**Platform**\\nUbuntu 24.04, Python 3.12, Rich 14.3.3\",\n5\t  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n6\t  \"created_at\": \"2026-09-30T00:00:00Z\",\n7\t  \"labels\": [\n8\t    \"Needs triage\"\n9\t  ]\n10\t}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b52d415b-d4fc-4d54-b956-28a9a3bd8b60","uuid":"fd8faaab-0bfa-4b69-9ec8-2af2ac7f20f3","timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:10:59.374Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/gh-aw/agent/issue.json","content":"{\n  \"number\": 626,\n  \"title\": \"[BUG] Syntax with line_range and word_wrap=True omits the final line\",\n  \"body\": \"- [x] I've checked docs and closed issues for possible solutions.\\n- [x] I can't find my issue in the FAQ.\\n\\n**Describe the bug**\\n\\nWhen `word_wrap=True`, the last line of `line_range` is missing.\\n\\n```python\\nfrom rich.console import Console\\nfrom rich.syntax import Syntax\\n\\ncode = \\\"a = 1\\\\nb = 2\\\\nc = 3\\\\nd = 4\\\\n\\\"\\nConsole(width=40).print(Syntax(code, \\\"python\\\", line_range=(2, 4), word_wrap=True))\\n```\\n\\nI expected `b = 2`, `c = 3` and `d = 4`; `d = 4` is not printed.\\n\\n**Platform**\\nUbuntu 24.04, Python 3.12, Rich 14.3.3\",\n  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-09-30T00:00:00Z\",\n  \"labels\": [\n    \"Needs triage\"\n  ]\n}","numLines":10,"startLine":1,"totalLines":10}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01BE3HtJqSLJ6qYKksgCdsex","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
